#   2026-10-14 Release 1.1.0 (30c5f44: CORE_VERSION v1.1.0): SEED 1 first roll PASS, clk_dec 102.84 / 104.12,
#     clk_vid 91.69 / 91.99, HDMI gate PASS, lint / canary PASS; ALM 40,943 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110,
#     H264_20261014.rbf (--release).
#   2026-10-16 dev-calibration (interface 1.2 geometry, before availability retime):
#     SEED 1 clk_dec 100.75 / 100.08, clk_vid 88.18 / 85.00 -- MARGINAL;
#     ALM 41,130 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110. SEED 2 clk_dec 97.03 / 96.78,
#     clk_vid 90.84 / 87.32 -- decoder MARGINAL; ALM 41,175, RAM 421, DSP 110.
#     Neither fit deployed. Cold decoder census: external neighbour availability
#     through C/D selection into mv_pred.nb_sel_q; geometry is not a limiting path.
#   2026-10-16 dev-calibration (external availability captured in S_PREP2): SEED 2,
#     clk_dec 97.39 / 99.06 -- MARGINAL; clk_vid 93.52 / 89.58 PASS;
#     ALM 41,158 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110. Not deployed; decoder and
#     cross-clock hold paths require another timing census before qualification.
#   2026-10-16 dev-calibration (resolved availability captured in S_PREP2): SEED 2,
#     clk_dec 100.82 / 99.47 -- MARGINAL; clk_vid 94.11 / 89.92 PASS;
#     ALM 41,101 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110. Strict release refused; not deployed.
#   2026-10-16 dev-calibration (CABAC fixed-width initialization specialization):
#     SEED 2 clk_dec 92.71 / 94.59 -- FAIL; clk_vid 91.73 / 88.91 PASS;
#     ALM 41,250 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110. Strict release refused; not deployed.
#     Same synthesis SEED 1: clk_dec 100.86 / 98.34 -- FAIL;
#     clk_vid 90.51 / 86.84 PASS; ALM 41,210 / 41,910, RAM 421, DSP 110.
#     Cold limiter: serial dropped-store population count; hot: SPS return-state mux.
#   2026-10-16 dev-calibration (DPB balanced dropped-store count + qualified seed 1):
#     clk_dec 102.65 / 102.17 PASS (101.4 MHz gate); clk_vid 91.53 / 88.15 PASS
#     (86 MHz gate); ALM 41,180 / 41,910, registers 56,960, RAM 421, DSP 110.
#     H264_calibration_20261016_2357.rbf, SHA-256
#     09d868ebfc75412a18c1bad2527d5787a89372c94c4c5f034b777e95111ae968; 4,421,120 bytes.
#     Strict build gates PASS; Mister Pi fit/crop telemetry PASS with DeFlicker
#     off/on. Physical CRT picture validation remains pending.

set_global_assignment -name TOP_LEVEL_ENTITY sys_top
set_global_assignment -name ORIGINAL_QUARTUS_VERSION 17.0
set_global_assignment -name PROJECT_CREATION_TIME_DATE "08:00:00  SEPTEMBER 27, 2026"
set_global_assignment -name LAST_QUARTUS_VERSION "17.0.2 Lite Edition"
set_global_assignment -name PROJECT_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY output_files
set_global_assignment -name MIN_CORE_JUNCTION_TEMP "-40"
set_global_assignment -name MAX_CORE_JUNCTION_TEMP 100
set_global_assignment -name ERROR_CHECK_FREQUENCY_DIVISOR 256

